  <!-- EN: Advance team -->
  <GR_Crashlanded.label>灰裔先遣队</GR_Crashlanded.label>
  <!-- EN: Usually, before a colonization fleet arrives, an advance team is sent to conduct early planetary reconnaissance: estimating habitability, mapping local factions, and assessing potential threats...\nYou will serve as the captain of this reconnaissance operation, leading a team of advance scouts.\nMake the most of your team's strengths, gather resources, establish a foothold, make contact with local factions, and clear out potential threats.\nA7 reconnaissance team member data uploading. Ground-orbit two-way transmission link established. Guidance beacon lit. Approach clear. Drop authorized. Good luck and godspeed. -->
  <GR_Crashlanded.description>通常来说，在殖民舰队抵达前，往往会事先派出先遣队进行星球早期勘察，包括估计星球宜居度，了解本地势力分布，与对潜在的威胁进行等级评估……\n你将作为本次勘察行动的队长，指导一组先遣队执行任务。\n充分发挥队员的长处，收集资源并建立据点，与当地势力接触，并扫清潜在威胁。\nA7勘察小组成员信息上传中，地轨双向传输链路已建立，诱导已亮，前方净空，准许投射。祝君武运昌隆。</GR_Crashlanded.description>
  <!-- EN: Usually, before a colonization fleet arrives, an advance team is sent to conduct early planetary reconnaissance: estimating habitability, mapping local factions, and assessing potential threats...\nYou will serve as the captain of this reconnaissance operation, leading a team of advance scouts.\nMake the most of your team's strengths, gather resources, establish a foothold, make contact with local factions, and clear out potential threats.\nA7 reconnaissance team member data uploading. Ground-orbit two-way transmission link established. Guidance beacon lit. Approach clear. Drop authorized. Good luck and godspeed. -->
  <GR_Crashlanded.scenario.description>通常来说，在殖民舰队抵达前，往往会事先派出先遣队进行星球早期勘察，包括估计星球宜居度，了解本地势力分布，与对潜在的威胁进行等级评估……\n你将作为本次勘察行动的队长，指导一组先遣队执行任务。\n充分发挥队员的长处，收集资源并建立据点，与当地势力接触，并扫清潜在威胁。\nA7勘察小组成员信息上传中，地轨双向传输链路已建立，诱导已亮，前方净空，准许投射。祝君武运昌隆。</GR_Crashlanded.scenario.description>
  <!-- EN: Advance team -->
  <GR_Crashlanded.scenario.name>先遣队</GR_Crashlanded.scenario.name>
  <!-- EN: The moment their feet touched solid soil, it always brought a mysterious joy to those who had drifted in space for so long.\n"Communications clear. This is the advance team's mothership."\nThe two who had left the fleet and fallen onto this planet like meteors each held different thoughts.\n"Yes, we've received the preliminary planetary survey samples. Good work. The personnel you requested are on their way. Until then, you're on your own."\nThe liaison officer's rambling reminders echoed in their ears, distant beneath the static.\n"Also, we've detected claims from a hostile faction. The data has been synchronized. Be careful."\nThe story of the past is now a prologue. A new chapter begins with the first crude wooden wall.\n"Good luck with the expansion."\nMay this story have a happy ending. -->
  <GR_Crashlanded.scenario.parts.GameStartDialog.text>踩上结实泥土的那一刻，总会让长期漂泊在太空中的人产生一种无从解释的欣喜。\n“通讯畅通，这里是先遣队主舰。”\n脱离舰队、如流星般坠落在这颗星球上的二人，各自怀着不同的念头。\n“嗯，已经收到星球的初步探测样本了，做的不错，调遣的人手已经在路上了，在那之前，你们得靠自己了。”\n联络官琐碎的嘱托在耳边回荡，伴随着信号的杂音，却显得有些遥远。\n“另外，监测到敌对派系的宣称，数据已同步过去了，请务必小心。”\n往日的故事已成序章，新的篇章将从第一座简陋的木墙开始。\n“祝开拓成功。”\n愿这场故事，有个美好的结局。</GR_Crashlanded.scenario.parts.GameStartDialog.text>
  <!-- EN: The story of three Gray colonists building a settlement on the rimworld. -->
  <GR_Crashlanded.scenario.summary>三名灰裔殖民者在边缘世界建立殖民地的故事。</GR_Crashlanded.scenario.summary>
  
</LanguageData>